  "title": "Special Green Bean Bake",
  "description": "Canned green beans are tossed with sweet pickle relish and pimentos in this zingy twist on the classic green bean casserole. Crumbled bacon adds a nice smoky taste.",
  "authors": [
    "white1969"
  ],
